        "text": "Questions\nNow that you have a clear idea of how to manage software packages, here are some exercises that will\ncontribute further to your learning:\n1.\nMake a list of all the packages installed on your system.\nHint : Consider using the apt list --installed command.\n2.\nAdd support for flatpaks on your Ubuntu system.\nHint : Follow the documentation at flatpak.org .\n3.\nTest other distributions and use their package managers. We recommend that you try openSUSE\nand, if you feel confident, Arch Linux.",
